    "body": "Enable IPC on 32-bit x86. It was chosen arbitrarily in #31802 to have coverage for `-DENABLE_IPC=OFF`, but this was not a good choice given issues like:\n- https://github.com/bitcoin-core/libmultiprocess/pull/383\n\nI could not find a good candidate CI configuration to disable IPC.\n\nUntil #32387 it's still disabled on Windows. It's also disabled on RISC-V.\n\n(draft to make sure CI actually works)",
